     "text": "June 27, 2026\n@ 3:00 pm\n- 5:00 pm"
    },
    {
     "t": "image",
     "ref": "assets/source/0ad1f431-Good-Feels_Good-Vibes_200px.png",
     "srcUrl": "https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Good-Feels_Good-Vibes_200px.png?lossy=2&strip=0&webp=1",
     "alt": "Good Feels / Good Vibes Pop-Up",
     "w": 200,
     "h": 219,
     "kind": "event-image"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><strong>Join us on Saturday June 27, 2026 from 3pm – 5pm and learn more about Good Feels / Good Vibes <em>fast-acting</em> products and<i> enjoy some of their swag.</i></strong></p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "LOOKS GOOD. TASTES GOOD. FEELS GOOD."
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "We make cannabis-infused beverages for those who want more out of life."
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Our line up of products can replace alcohol in every setting. This experience starts with our 12oz stubby bottles of cannabis-infused seltzers. We also have our fast-acting beverage enhancers for the at home mixologist. Both are <strong>zero sugar</strong> and have <strong>zero calories</strong>.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><img src=\"assets/source/8c3cbc26-good-vibes-product-1024x389.png\" alt=\"Good Vibes at Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet, MA\" width=\"1024\" height=\"389\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/good-vibes-product-1024x389.png?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\" data-master=\"assets/source/080b38cb-good-vibes-product.png\"></p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Come vibe with us"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Unveiling ‘GOOD VIBES’ Fast Acting Syrup! Elevate your moments with 500mg THC for ultimate euphoria and taste.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><a href=\"/brands/good-feels/\"><strong>Click here to shop Good Feels / Good Vibes products!</strong></a></p>"
    },
